[2026-05-10T07:02:35.578Z] [STDOUT] Fixes #20

## Summary

- Replaces the placeholder SQL text editor with a legacy-compatible report builder for report type `22`, report columns type `28`, and manual joins type `44`.
- Serializes SQL builder settings through the same requisite ids used by `templates/sql.html`, including filters, format, function, order, totals, formula, HAVING, SET, source alias, interactive mode, and report limit.
- Adds `/:database/sql/:reportId?` and `/:database/query/:reportId?` routing, keeps the old `IntegramSQL` component on the new builder surface, and fixes report viewer route navigation.
- Adds a parity checklist and a reviewer screenshot.

## Screenshot

![SQL query builder](https://github.com/ideav/vue-gram/blob/issue-20-b1f6be2bb496/docs/screenshots/sql-query-builder-parity.png?raw=true)

## Reproduction / Verification

- Open `/:database/sql/:reportId` with a legacy SQL report.
- Change a column alias/filter/order/totals setting and verify `_m_set/{columnId}` receives the corresponding legacy requisite id.
- Refresh preview and verify `report/{reportId}?LIMIT={limit}` is used.

## Tests

- `npm test`
- `npx playwright test e2e/sql-query-builder.spec.ts`
- `npm run build`

Note: `npm run build` still reports the existing large chunk warning.

